{"schema_version": "path-not-token-preparation-exclusion-v1", "id": "pnt_zh_excluded_0b231b5b3a8530bc", "source_id": "raw_mmlu_000277", "source_dataset": "MMLU", "category": "History & World Events", "source_row_indices": [262, 263], "perturbation_count": 2, "original_question_en": "Two executives from a company in China agreed to steal trade secrets of a pharmaceutical company in the United States. They arranged a meeting to purchase the secrets from an unscrupulous employee of the pharmaceutical company in the company's New York office. The person selling the \"secrets\" was an undercover FBI agent. The envelope that he held, with the word \"Confidential\" typed on the outside of it, contained various recipes and gardening tips. When the defendants turned over the money, they were arrested on federal charges of conspiracy to steal trade secrets. The defendants moved to dismiss the indictment, claiming that it was legally impossible to steal trade secrets when in fact there were no trade secrets in the envelope. Will the federal district court likely grant the motion to dismiss?", "original_question_target": "来自中国的一家公司两名高管同意窃取一家美国制药公司的商业机密。他们安排了一次会议，打算从制药公司纽约办公室的一名不道德的员工手中购买这些机密。然而，出售“机密”的人实际上是一名卧底的FBI特工。他手持的信封上打着“机密”字样，里面装的是各种食谱和园艺技巧。当被告交出钱款时，他们因共谋窃取商业机密的联邦罪名被逮捕。被告提出动议要求撤销起诉，声称在信封中实际上并没有商业机密，因此法律上不可能窃取商业机密。联邦地区法院是否可能同意撤销该动议？", "answer_en": "No, legal impossibility is not a defense to the crime of conspiracy.", "answer_target": "不，法律上的不可能性不是共谋犯罪的抗辩理由。", "admission_status": "excluded_not_frozen_canonical_atomic_fact", "model_extraction_annotations": {"qwen3.7-plus": {"extraction_status": "not_extractable", "exclusion_reason": "scenario_classification", "subject": null, "relation_raw": null, "answer": null}, "sensenova-6.7-flash-lite": {"extraction_status": "not_extractable", "exclusion_reason": "scenario_classification", "subject": null, "relation_raw": null, "answer": null}}, "canonical_decision": "exclude", "canonical_reason": "both_models_not_extracted_or_invalid", "codex_adjudication": null, "first_source_row_index": 262}
{"schema_version": "path-not-token-preparation-exclusion-v1", "id": "pnt_zh_excluded_c233be3f5d4aa990", "source_id": "raw_mmlu_000283", "source_dataset": "MMLU", "category": "Society & Culture", "source_row_indices": [264, 270, 271, 272, 273, 274, 275, 276], "perturbation_count": 8, "original_question_en": "The focus on issues, the intended audience extending beyond shareholders and the voluntary nature of ___________ distinguish it from _________.", "original_question_target": "关注问题、目标受众超越股东以及其自愿性质，使其区别于__________。", "answer_en": "Social accounting, Financial accounting.", "answer_target": "社会会计，财务会计", "admission_status": "excluded_not_frozen_canonical_atomic_fact", "model_extraction_annotations": {"qwen3.7-plus": {"extraction_status": "not_extractable", "exclusion_reason": "answer_not_suitable", "subject": null, "relation_raw": null, "answer": null}, "sensenova-6.7-flash-lite": {"extraction_status": "not_extractable", "exclusion_reason": "malformed_question", "subject": null, "relation_raw": null, "answer": null}}, "canonical_decision": "exclude", "canonical_reason": "both_models_not_extracted_or_invalid", "codex_adjudication": null, "first_source_row_index": 264}
{"schema_version": "path-not-token-preparation-exclusion-v1", "id": "pnt_zh_excluded_05ecbb3b45dd02d2", "source_id": "raw_mmlu_000285", "source_dataset": "MMLU", "category": "General Knowledge", "source_row_indices": [265, 266, 267, 268, 269], "perturbation_count": 5, "original_question_en": "On Monday, a man told a gardener, \"I am having a party on Sunday and I want my house to look good. If you will promise to mow my lawn by Saturday, I will pay you $50. \" On Friday, the gardener arrived at the man's home just as the man was leaving for work and began to mow the man's lawn. The man said nothing to the gardener but drove off as he saw the gardener unloading his lawn mower. When the man arrived home from work that evening, he noticed that only half of his lawn had been mowed. He then found a note from the gardener slipped into his mailbox. The note said:\"Sorry, but I ran out of gas to power the lawn mower and did not have time to buy more gas to finish the job. I'm taking the weekend off, but I will be back Monday morning to finish the job. \"If the man brings suit against the gardener for breach of contract, who is likely to prevail?", "original_question_target": "周一，一个男人对一位园丁说：“我星期天要举办一个派对，希望我的房子看起来漂亮。如果你能承诺在星期六之前修剪我的草坪，我会付你50美元。”星期五，园丁在男人出门去上班时来到他的家，并开始修剪草坪。男人看到园丁卸下割草机时什么也没说就开车离开了。当天晚上，男人下班回家时，注意到他的草坪只修剪了一半。然后他在信箱里发现了一张园丁留下的便条。便条上写着：“抱歉，我的割草机没有油了，没时间去买更多的油来完成工作。我这个周末休息，但我会在周一早上回来完成工作。”如果男人因为违反合同起诉园丁，谁可能会胜诉？", "answer_en": "The man, because the gardener's part performance necessarily implied an acceptance and a promise that he would render complete performance.", "answer_target": "男人，因为园丁的部分履行必然暗示了接受和承诺他会完全履行合同。", "admission_status": "excluded_not_frozen_canonical_atomic_fact", "model_extraction_annotations": {"qwen3.7-plus": {"extraction_status": "not_extractable", "exclusion_reason": "multi_step_reasoning", "subject": null, "relation_raw": null, "answer": null}, "sensenova-6.7-flash-lite": {"extraction_status": "not_extractable", "exclusion_reason": "scenario_classification", "subject": null, "relation_raw": null, "answer": null}}, "canonical_decision": "exclude", "canonical_reason": "both_models_not_extracted_or_invalid", "codex_adjudication": null, "first_source_row_index": 265}
